Package: php@PHPV@-resvg
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: php
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Fojle Rabbi (Rabib) <FojleRabbiRabib@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: php@PHPV@-common
Homepage: https://github.com/FojleRabbiRabib/resvg-php
Description: SVG rasterization for PHP on a vendored resvg core
 resvg renders SVG to PNG from PHP in-process, using a vendored build of the
 resvg renderer statically linked into the extension. Output is byte-identical
 to the upstream resvg command-line tool built from the same source.
 .
 This package is built for the PHP @PHPV@ API and installs the module into that
 API's extension directory only.
